    "one_liner": "用于计算分子图唯一环族（URF）、相关环（RC）与最小环基（SSSR）的 ANSI C 算法库，并带可选 Python 封装。",
    "ecosystem": "cpp",
    "bindings": ["python"]
  },
  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "RingDecomposerLib 是一个面向化学信息学与图论应用的 ANSI C 算法库，用于从无向图中计算唯一环族（Unique Ring Families, URF）、相关环（Relevant Cycles, RC）、相关环族（RCF）以及最小环基（SSSR，Smallest Set of Smallest Rings）。核心流程先用 Tarjan 算法分解双连通分量，再求解全源最短路径并应用 Vismara 算法发现环族，最后判断 URF 关系。库提供清晰的 C API 与可选的 Cython/Python 封装，方便在 Python 生态中调用。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "图构建 API",
        "description": "初始化图结构并添加无向边，为环分解准备输入数据。",
        "evidence": ["src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.h:141-161", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.c:57-66"]
      },
      {
        "name": "环与环族计算",
        "description": "执行完整的环分解流程：Tarjan 双连通分量分解、全源最短路径、Vismara RCF 发现、URF 关系判定，生成可查询的计算结果对象。",
        "evidence": ["src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.c:69-186", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLtarjan.c", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLapsp.c", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLcycleFams.c", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLrelation.c"]
      },
      {
        "name": "结果查询 API",
        "description": "获取 URF/RCF/环体系的数量、权重、节点、边以及成员关系等计算结果。",
        "evidence": ["src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.h:181-395", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.c:214-684"]
      },
      {
        "name": "相关环迭代器",
        "description": "提供基于迭代器的相关环枚举接口，避免一次性生成大量环。",
        "evidence": ["src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.h:437-471", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLhandler.c"]
      },
      {
        "name": "环体系（2-连通分量）查询",
        "description": "识别并返回图的 2-连通分量（环体系）及其包含的节点与边。",
        "evidence": ["src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.h:683-745", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RingDecomposerLib.c:1589-1703"]
      },
      {
        "name": "DIMACS 文件输入",
        "description": "解析 DIMACS 格式的图与参考环定义文件，用于测试与验证。",
        "evidence": ["src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLdimacs.c", "src/RingDecomposerLib/RDLdimacs.h"]
      },
      {
        "name": "Python 封装",
        "description": "基于 Cython 将 C 核心库包装为 py_rdl 包，提供 Graph、Calculator、Cycle 等 Pythonic 接口。",
